<title>FRANCE: France reports free market wheat, barley bids.</title>
<headline>France reports free market wheat, barley bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Dec 12 ---		 --- Dec 5 ---</p>
<p>		  Tonnage   Range of Bids    Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat 1,322,200   16.47-21.74	662,800   17.93-21.87</p>
<p> Barley	 143,600   30.49-34.26	296,000   30.50-32.00</p>
<p> Durum wheat   34,100    4.98-14.47	 49,800    4.98-30.00</p>
<p> Rye		    No bids			    No bid</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
